{"id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-cohen.md","title":"Cohen Forcing","display":"df-cohen — Cohen Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cohen","aliases":["58-df-cohen"],"display":"df-cohen — Cohen Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cohen"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cohen</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cohen — Cohen Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohen} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\nP=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P((\\kappa\\times\\omega)\\times2):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),2)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\subseteq\\kappa\\times\\omega\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\omega\\}\\land\n\\leq_P=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:p\\supseteq q\\}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohen} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\nP=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P((\\kappa\\times\\omega)\\times2):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),2)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\subseteq\\kappa\\times\\omega\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\omega\\}\\land\n\\leq_P=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:p\\supseteq q\\}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the usual <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)\\)</span> presentation: finite partial functions from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\times\\omega\">\\(\\kappa\\times\\omega\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>, ordered by reverse inclusion.</li>\n<li>Cohen forcing satisfies the c.c.c. (countable chain condition).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"t